<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH METROSTAV 9MO GROSS PROFIT RISES.</title>
<headline>CZECH METROSTAV 9MO GROSS PROFIT RISES.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results for nine</p>
<p>months ending September 30, 1996:</p>
<p>(in millions of crowns)</p>
<p> Gross profit		    95.200	vs	73.840</p>
<p> Operating profit		84.500	vs	82.331</p>
<p>Sales of own goods</p>
<p> and services		 3,400.000	vs   3,329.939</p>
<p> Production		   3,900.000	vs   3,378.004</p>
<p> Total assets		 3,000.000	vs   2,988.035</p>
<p> Basic capital		  508.900	vs     475.589</p>
<p>Note. Full company name is Metrostav a.s. . The</p>
<p>company is a builder concetrating mainly on tunnelling and</p>
<p>other underground and surface works. It is listed on the main</p>
<p>market of the Prague Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
